{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1263"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge art/architecture","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/art__architecture.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",84],["-","approaches."],["+","approaches, and a gas holder in the Ruhr shows how far the idea of the found space can go."],["=",17],["-","Bankside"],["+","Before"],["=",1],["+","the museum moved in, the building was a power station (Bankside "],["=",2],["-","Station,"],["+","Station),"],["=",803],["+","Germany's Ruhr took the idea further still. The Gasometer Oberhausen, a 117.5-metre disc-type gas holder built in 1927–1929 to store blast-furnace gas, was shut down in 1988 and narrowly escaped demolition. For the IBA Emscher Park the city converted it in 1993–1994 into an exhibition hall – Europe's tallest – which opened in 1994 with the show \"Feuer und Flamme\"; its vast empty drum, now crossed by lifts and a glass roof viewing platform, has housed exhibitions and installations ever since.\n\n"],["=",8],["-","palace:"],["+","palace,"],["=",1],["+","gas holder: "],["=",31]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",86],["-","Wege."],["+","Wege, und ein Gasbehälter im Ruhrgebiet zeigt, wie weit sich die Idee des gefundenen Raums treiben lässt."],["=",15],["-","Die"],["+","Bevor"],["=",1],["-","Bankside"],["+","das"],["=",1],["+","Museum einzog, war das Gebäude ein Kraftwerk (Bankside "],["=",2],["-","Station,"],["+","Station),"],["=",725],["+","Das Ruhrgebiet trieb die Idee noch weiter. Der Gasometer Oberhausen, ein 117,5 Meter hoher Scheibengasbehälter, 1927–1929 zur Speicherung von Gichtgas gebaut, wurde 1988 stillgelegt und entging knapp dem Abriss. Für die IBA Emscher Park baute die Stadt ihn 1993–1994 zu einer Ausstellungshalle um – der höchsten Europas –, die 1994 mit der Schau „Feuer und Flamme“ eröffnete; seine riesige leere Trommel, heute von Aufzügen durchzogen und von einer gläsernen Aussichtsplattform auf dem Dach gekrönt, beherbergt seither Ausstellungen und Installationen.\n\n"],["=",4],["-","Palast:"],["+","Palast,"],["=",1],["+","Gasbehälter: "],["=",31]]}]},
